.TH "GLESHA-VERSION" "1" "" "glesha" "User Commands"
.nh
.ad l
.SH NAME
glesha\-version \- show version information
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBglesha version\fR [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the version and the source revision of this build.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
The global options described in glesha(1) are also accepted.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
glesha version
glesha \-\-version
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR glesha (1)
